The '''Recruiting board''' is a board that, when clicked, gives players the option to create a [[Chambers of Xeric]] raid party in their [[clan chat]]. Members with recruit rank and up can join the raid. Additionally, there is the option to publicly list the party on the recruiting board with preferred party size, combat level and skill total.

